  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Baek Ji-Yeong transfers to a new high school in hopes of starting fresh with her social life. However, rumors from middle school—that she has a “princess complex” and “plays the field”—follow her, and even after a month, she still hasn’t made any friends. She feels a sense of kinship with Yu Ji-U, who is also surrounded by rumors, and hopes they can become friends, but she gives up when she sees Ji-U putting up a wall against everyone in the class. Then, Ji-U begins to rapidly close the distance between them… \n\nAs she grows closer to Ji-U, rumors start spreading that they’re dating, and Ji-Yeong finds herself caught in a whirlwind of relationships. To a confused Ji-Yeong, Ji-U, who claimed to be just a friend, starts getting closer than just friends. \n\nCan we stay friends?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
